    "custom_viedo_list_YMpGVb": {
      "type": "custom-viedo-list",
      "blocks": {
        "video_slide_kJFKX9": {
          "type": "video_slide",
          "settings": {
            "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fuxH8yigxXg",
            "video_type": "youtube",
            "video_link": "",
            "video": "",
            "title": "The Ultimate Budget Macfox X7 Build",
            "text": "<p>he creator documents the process of customizing a brand-new Macfox X7 using cheap AliExpress parts, including a fake ODI number plate, a carbon fiber battery wrap, a new seat cover, and clean cable management</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_slide_N8CbEp": {
          "type": "video_slide",
          "settings": {
            "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mhyQ0utdu6k",
            "video_type": "youtube",
            "video_link": "",
            "video": "",
            "title": "Macfox X7 Dual Battery Deep Dive",
            "text": "<p>An in-depth review of the dual-battery X7, highlighting its super-wide fat tires (5\" in the rear, 4.5\" up front) and an ultra-comfortable long seat. While it lacks rear suspension and maxes out around 25 mph, its incredible stability and stopping power make it a highly safe, daily street commuter</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_slide_bkLYtE": {
          "type": "video_slide",
          "settings": {
            "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fLkkUQDt5Ho",
            "video_type": "youtube",
            "video_link": "",
            "video": "",
            "title": "The Perfect Affordable Super73 Alternative",
            "text": "<p>Reviewers point out that the Macfox X7 is a fantastic budget-friendly alternative to the Super73 Z-Series, coming in at nearly $1,000 less while packing a larger 48V 13Ah battery. With its gentle power delivery, it's an extremely beginner-friendly moped-style e-bike perfect for smooth pavement cruising.</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_slide_EdYVd6": {
          "type": "video_slide",
          "settings": {
            "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jtBrNiDANcU",
            "video_type": "youtube",
            "video_link": "",
            "video": "",
            "title": "Whisper-Quiet Motor & Premium Build Quality",
            "text": "<p>The creator highly praises the Macfox X7's premium build quality, noting that its motor is practically silent. The overall ride feel, smoothness, and brand prestige significantly outshine similarly priced competitors like the Ridstar.</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_slide_wdcNdq": {
          "type": "video_slide",
          "settings": {
            "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hnTF-m5RZjI",
            "video_type": "youtube",
            "video_link": "",
            "video": "",
            "title": "The Best Out-of-the-Box Wheelie Machine",
            "text": "<p>Showcasing the insane playability of the navy blue X7. The creator calls it the easiest e-bike to wheelie right out of the box, noting that its front suspension and overall build quality are far superior to the Ridstar.</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_slide_mkrBi8": {
          "type": "video_slide",
          "settings": {
            "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2KU7sZ-dbNY",
            "video_type": "youtube",
            "video_link": "",
            "video": "",
            "title": "Macfox M16 Unboxing & First Off-Road Ride",
            "text": "<p>A teen creator unboxes and test-rides the Macfox M16 off-road e-bike. Thanks to its massive fat tires, the bike delivers a buttery-smooth ride over grass, gravel, and bumpy dirt trails, making off-roading feel like riding on solid concrete.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
